    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A contemporary portrait of the crazy society we live in, told in a creative and unique way.&quot; This is Nose: Breathing Rebellion, a provocative, surreal, and complex caricature of our present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nose: Breathing Rebellion is a 2.5-3D puzzle and strategy video game. Set in a dark and cold city, it is ruled by Kovalev, an egotistical and haughty villain who infects the entire society with hatred and imprisons the &quot;weirdos.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Nose&quot; is the protagonist, a nose who no longer wishes to live in the villain's body. But he is not alone. He will find a hand, a mouth, and several eyes that have also escaped from evil bodies that do not represent them. But they have been captured...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Factories that generate hate, tubes that carry hate into our homes, an alienated society, the eye of Big Brother watching us... With &quot;Nose&quot; you'll face challenges designed to test your wit and determination, pushing you to free the city suffocated by hate. This game combines a 100% contemporary narrative with a dark aesthetic, offering an unforgettable experience of rebellion and freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Immersive Narrative: Experience a story of our present day that combines satire, surrealism, and dystopia, and where rebellion is the answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D Puzzles: Traverse a dark and oppressive world with intricate levels that will require strategy and memory skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth Mechanics: Avoid detection and deceive enemies by using the environment to your advantage, emphasizing strategy over direct confrontation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815040/extras/dadfe329e892d55ef65927bb9bc2a1ca.avif?t=1754307256\" width=200 height=65 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815040/extras/3c0a59e163147a41c4d55ab14e254169.avif?t=1754307256\" width=200 height=65 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815040/extras/a6c89c8ba92eada952dfe3d8fe39aef9.avif?t=1754307256\" width=200 height=65 /></span></p>",
